1. LICENCE TIERS
----------------
Your licence is one of the following two tiers, determined by your purchase and
bound to the email address recorded during setup:

  PERSONAL
    - Term: one (1) year from activation, renewable.
    - Devices: up to three (3) concurrent activated devices.
    - Intended for an individual's own use.

  COMMERCIAL
    - Term: two (2) years from activation, renewable.
    - Devices: up to five (5) concurrent activated devices.
    - Permitted for use within a single organisation.

FEATURE PARITY. Both tiers provide the SAME market-data functionality and the
same read access to all data features. The tiers differ ONLY in: (a) the number
of concurrent activated devices, (b) licence duration, and (c) the quantitative
workspace and timeframe limits associated with your tier. No market-data feature
is withheld from either paid tier.


2. LICENCE VERIFICATION AND DEVICE BINDING
------------------------------------------
The Software enforces this licence by software. On first start and periodically
thereafter, the Software verifies your licence with Licensor's licensing service
over an encrypted channel. To perform verification the Software transmits only:
your licence email, a coarse device description, an installation identifier, a
derived machine fingerprint, and the build tier. It does NOT transmit your
trading activity, your exchange API credentials, your orders, or your market
data; exchange connections are made directly from your machine.

You acknowledge and agree that:
  (a) THE SOFTWARE WILL NOT RUN without successful verification. If verification
      returns an invalid result (no active licence, wrong tier, expired term,
      device limit reached, or a machine-binding mismatch), the Software will
      not start, or will stop if already running.
  (b) Each activation is BOUND to the machine on which it is installed. Moving an
      installation's identity to a different machine invalidates it.
  (c) Your concurrent activated devices are limited to your tier's device count.
      If you lose or replace a machine and reach your limit, contact
      support@pricesylo.com to release a device seat.
  (d) Circumventing, disabling, or tampering with the verification or
      anti-tamper mechanisms is a material breach and terminates this licence
      automatically.


